{"id":"H7276","lemma":"רֶ֫גֶם","transliteration":"regem","sayIt":"RE-gem","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Regem","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.2.47;\nson of Caleb (H3612H) and Jahdai (H3056);\nbrother of: Jotham (H3147I), Geshan (H1529), Pelet (H6404), Ephah (H5891I) and Shaaph (H8174)\n§ Regem = \"friend\"\nson of Jahdai and descendant of Caleb","glosses":["regem"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":47,"renderings":{"bsb":"Regem","kjv":"Regem"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:47","note":"The sons of Jahdai: Regem, Jothan, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, and Shaaph.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1529","lemma":"גֵּישָׁן","transliteration":"geshan","gloss":"Geshan"},{"id":"H3056","lemma":"יַהְדַּי","transliteration":"yehday","gloss":"Jahdai"},{"id":"H3147","lemma":"יוֹתָם","transliteration":"yotam","gloss":"Jotham"},{"id":"H5891","lemma":"עֵיפָה","transliteration":"ephah","gloss":"Ephah"},{"id":"H6404","lemma":"פֶּ֫לֶט","transliteration":"pelet","gloss":"Pelet"},{"id":"H8174","lemma":"שַׁ֫עַף","transliteration":"shaaph","gloss":"Shaaph"},{"id":"H3612","lemma":"כָּלֵב","transliteration":"kalev","gloss":"Caleb"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}